cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BioShiny in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "BioShiny: a modular R Shiny application for bulk and single-cell RNA-seq analysis"
abstract: >-
  BioShiny is a modular R Shiny application for interactive RNA-seq analysis.
  The bulk workflow covers data import and validation, quality control,
  normalisation (TMM, RLE, VST), ComBat-Seq batch correction, differential
  expression (DESeq2, edgeR, limma-voom), GO/KEGG enrichment and GSEA, and a
  rendered HTML report. The single-cell workflow covers Seurat QC, clustering
  and marker detection, Slingshot trajectory inference and CellChat
  cell-cell communication analysis.
authors:
